<title>FRANCE: EU to send Dutch Foreign Minister to Albania.</title>
<headline>EU to send Dutch Foreign Minister to Albania.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Prime Minister Wim Kok said on Wednesday that the European Union was sending his country's foreign minister to Albania on Friday for emergency talks on the crisis in the Balkan state.</p>
<p>Kok told reporters on a visit to Paris that Dutch Foreign Minister Hans Van Mierlo had spoken to Albanian President Sali Berisha earlier on Wednesday and would fly to Tirana on Friday to seek a political solution on the EU's behalf.</p>
</text>
